# Ephara's Dispersal at a creature that is not attacking costs the full {2}{U} (CR 601.2f), here paid exactly by Black
# Lotus; the pool is empty right after. The target may be the caster's own creature (Ornithopter returns to Bot2's hand).
# Surveil 2 then puts both cards back on top in the order given (Mountain over Forest, top first).

